EVALUATION ORDER ALLOW, DENY

.*XCS.*                   ALLOW
XCS:USER:SND:MODEL.*      ALLOW RWML


# Keep this as the last pattern please
# Add write permission for gateway diagnostic pvs
NET:CAG:XCS:SND:ML.*      ALLOW RWML 1

# To reread config file:
#	caput NET:CAG:XCS:newAsFlag 1
# Note: this gives the ML process the ability to restart its own gateway via PV
# But the rest of us can't write to this gateway at all, by design, so restart the other way
